# cc project views and safe local update policy
# Format: PROJECT_NAME | PICKER_GROUP | AUTO_UPDATE | REASON
#
# PICKER_GROUP:
#   primary  — shown in the main cc project picker
#   managed  — kept locally for publishing/integration, shown in a secondary picker
#   archive  — legacy review workspace, shown in the same secondary picker
#
# AUTO_UPDATE only performs a clean, fast-forward update from the configured
# Git upstream. Dirty, ahead, diverged, missing, and non-Git directories are
# reported and left untouched.

ai-workflow-foundry | primary | true | AI workflow flagship
ai-workspace-manager | managed | true | portable public snapshot of the private source project
confera-media-skills | managed | true | separately versioned public extension pack
feedback-analysis-system | managed | true | public product snapshot
print-ready-nameplate-generator | managed | true | public reference workflow
